ode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780972160530_vxmy3pybz","characterId":"cdb984bf-99fb-4b68-ba65-6d2ddf695db0","_id":191965},{"id":1792394860911,"text":"有几个嘛……?","sender":"me","time":"15:42","timestamp":1792395747956,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780972160530_vxmy3pybz","characterId":"cdb984bf-99fb-4b68-ba65-6d2ddf695db0","_id":191966},{"id":1792394860912,"text":"不就做了两次","sender":"me","time":"15:42","timestamp":1792395752117,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780972160530_vxmy3pybz","characterId":"cdb984bf-99fb-4b68-ba65-6d2ddf695db0","_id":191967},{"id":1792394860913,"text":"（抱紧亲）","sender":"me","time":"15:42","timestamp":1792395755774,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780972160530_vxmy3pybz","characterId":"cdb984bf-99fb-4b68-ba65-6d2ddf695db0","_id":191968},{"id":1792394860915,"text":"主卧厚重的双层遮光帘将正午的日光滤成一片静谧的灰金。随着林予安软绵绵地扑进怀里并主动送上亲吻，纪池原本因脱力而微敞的胸膛发出一阵低沉愉悦的震颤。少年微卷凌乱的黑发陷在深灰色的枕头里，左耳的银钉掠过细碎的光芒。他顺从地闭上那双狭长深邃的桃花眼，修长结实的手臂自然而然地收拢，宽大的手掌牢牢托住女孩纤薄的后背，仰起下颌极其享受地迎接着这个带着清甜气息的安抚。","rawContent":"主卧厚重的双层遮光帘将正午的日光滤成一片静谧的灰金。随着林予安软绵绵地扑进怀里并主动送上亲吻，纪池原本因脱力而微敞的胸膛发出一阵低沉愉悦的震颤。少年微卷凌乱的黑发陷在深灰色的枕头里，左耳的银钉掠过细碎的光芒。他顺从地闭上那双狭长深邃的桃花眼，修长结实的手臂自然而然地收拢，宽大的手掌牢牢托住女孩纤薄的后背，仰起下颌极其享受地迎接着这个带着清甜气息的安抚。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:43","timestamp":1792395808301,"roundId":"round_1792395773105_qhqyml22i","generatedMode":false,"type":"state","hasThinking":true,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780972160530_vxmy3pybz","characterId":"cdb984bf-99fb-4b68-ba65-6d2ddf695db0","_id":191969},{"id":1792394860916,"text":"叮——小狗当前电量百分之十。","rawContent":"叮——小狗当前电量百分之十。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:43","timestamp":1792395808306,"roundId":"round_1792395773105_qhqyml22i","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780972160530_vxmy3pybz","characterId":"cdb984bf-99fb-4b68-ba65-6d2ddf695db0","_id":191970},{"id":1792394860917,"text":"离满电下床给你做饭还差得远呢，林考官还得再亲九下才行。","rawContent":"离满电下床给你做饭还差得远呢，林考官还得再亲九下才行。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:43","timestamp":1792395808760,"roundId":"round_1792395773105_qhqyml22i","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780972160530_vxmy3pybz","characterId":"cdb984bf-99fb-4b68-ba65-6d2ddf695db0","_id":191971},{"id":1792394860918,"text":"一吻结束，两人微凉与滚烫的鼻息在极近的方寸间亲昵地交织。纪池半阖着眼，长睫下漫着未褪尽的慵懒与迷离。他略带惩罚意味地用带着薄茧的指腹轻轻捏了捏林予安泛着红晕的后颈软肉，清俊的面庞上浮起一抹好气又好笑的无奈。","rawContent":"一吻结束，两人微凉与滚烫的鼻息在极近的方寸间亲昵地交织。纪池半阖着眼，长睫下漫着未褪尽的慵懒与迷离。他略带惩罚意味地用带着薄茧的指腹轻轻捏了捏林予安泛着红晕的后颈软肉，清俊的面庞上浮起一抹好气又好笑的无奈。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:43","timestamp":1792395809677,"roundId":"round_1792395773105_qhqyml22i","generatedMode":false,"type":"state","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780972160530_vxmy3pybz","characterId":"cdb984bf-99fb-4b68-ba65-6d2ddf695db0","_id":191972},{"id":1792394860919,"text":"还有，什么叫“不就做了两次”？","rawContent":"还有，什么叫“不就做了两次”？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:43","timestamp":1792395809783,"roundId":"round_1792395773105_qhqyml22i","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780972160530_vxmy3pybz","characterId":"cdb984bf-99fb-4b68-ba65-6d2ddf695db0","_id":191973},{"id":1792394860920,"text":"林予安你这算盘打得，我在政法大学的教室里都听见了。","rawContent":"林予安你这算盘打得，我在政法大学的教室里都听见了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:43","timestamp":1792395809989,"roundId":"round_1792395773105_qhqyml22i","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780972160530_vxmy3pybz","characterId":"cdb984bf-99fb-4b68-ba65-6d2ddf695db0","_id":191974},{"id":1792394860921,"text":"昨晚折腾到大半夜算一次，今天一上午你跨在我身上连吃带吸的算一次……你这两次加起来的时长，别人都能跑完半程马拉松了。","rawContent":"昨晚折腾到大半夜算一次，今天一上午你跨在我身上连吃带吸的算一次……你这两次加起来的时长，别人都能跑完半程马拉松了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:43","timestamp":1792395810304,"roundId":"round_1792395773105_qhqyml22i","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780972160530_vxmy3pybz","characterId":"cdb984bf-99fb-4b68-ba65-6d2ddf695db0","_id":191975},{"id":1792394860922,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:43","timestamp":1792395812574,"roundId":"round_1792395773105_qhqyml22i","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"唔……而且刚才某人高潮的时候夹得那么死，把小狗的魂都给抽干了，现在吃饱了就不认账了是不是？坏小猪。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"lazy","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780972160530_vxmy3pybz","characterId":"cdb984bf-99fb-4b68-ba65-6d2ddf695db0","_id":191976},{"id":1792394860923,"text":"别想转移话题，还有九下。","rawContent":"别想转移话题，还有九下。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:43","timestamp":1792395812581,"roundId":"round_1792395773105_qhqyml22i","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780972160530_vxmy3pybz","characterId":"cdb984bf-99fb-4b68-ba65-6d2ddf695db0","_id":191977},{"id":1792394860924,"text":"亲不完今天中午我们俩就只能饿死在这张床上了。","rawContent":"亲不完今天中午我们俩就只能饿死在这张床上了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:43","timestamp":1792395812586,"roundId":"round_1792395773105_qhqyml22i","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780972160530_vxmy3pybz","characterId":"cdb984bf-99fb-4b68-ba65-6d2ddf695db0","_id":191978},{"id":1792394860925,"text":"","rawContent":"","isHtml":false,"sticker":"https://i.postimg.cc/hjwSbwqg/mmexport1779001266197.jpg","stickerMeaning":"凑近","sender":"them","time":"15:43","timestamp":1792395813248,"roundId":"round_1792395773105_qhqyml22i","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780972160530_vxmy3pybz","characterId":"cdb984bf-99fb-4b68-ba65-6d2ddf695db0","_id":191979},{"id":1792394860926,"text":"那我舌吻!","sender":"me","time":"15:43","timestamp":1792395828227,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780972160530_vxmy3pybz","characterId":"cdb984bf-99fb-4b68-ba65-6d2ddf695db0","_id":191980},{"id":1792394860927,"text":"法式舌吻","sender":"me","time":"15:43","timestamp":1792395833544,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780972160530_vxmy3pybz","characterId":"cdb984bf-99fb-4b68-ba65-6d2ddf695db0","_id":191981},{"id":1792394860930,"text":"主卧厚重的双层窗帘将深秋正午的明亮彻底隔绝，只漏下几缕昏沉温柔的灰金光晕。地暖无声地烘烤着空气，将交缠的白茶清香与靡丽的腥甜气息蒸腾得愈发浓稠。听到林予安这句理直气壮的“法式舌吻”，纪池仰躺在深灰色的床单上，结实赤裸的胸膛因一阵低哑愉悦的闷笑而微微震颤。少年微卷凌乱的黑发深陷在柔软的枕头里，左耳那枚精巧的小圆珠银钉在暗光下掠过一道温润的微芒。他狭长深邃的桃花眼里彻底化开了纵容与溺爱，修长冷白的脖颈微微仰起，喉结极具张力地上下滑动了一下。带着薄茧的大手从女孩纤细的侧腰一路向上，极其自然地托住她的后脑勺与温软的后颈，修长的指节穿插进她汗湿的乌黑长发里。他微微张开微干发烫的薄唇，以一种完全不设防且任君采撷的姿态，安静又满含期待地迎接着她的降临。","rawContent":"主卧厚重的双层窗帘将深秋正午的明亮彻底隔绝，只漏下几缕昏沉温柔的灰金光晕。地暖无声地烘烤着空气，将交缠的白茶清香与靡丽的腥甜气息蒸腾得愈发浓稠。听到林予安这句理直气壮的“法式舌吻”，纪池仰躺在深灰色的床单上，结实赤裸的胸膛因一阵低哑愉悦的闷笑而微微震颤。少年微卷凌乱的黑发深陷在柔软的枕头里，左耳那枚精巧的小圆珠银钉在暗光下掠过一道温润的微芒。他狭长深邃的桃花眼里彻底化开了纵容与溺爱，修长冷白的脖颈微微仰起，喉结极具张力地上下滑动了一下。带着薄茧的大手从女孩纤细的侧腰一路向上，极其自然地托住她的后脑勺与温软的后颈，修长的指节穿插进她汗湿的乌黑长发里。他微微张开微干发烫的薄唇，以一种完全不设防且任君采撷的姿态，安静又满含期待地迎接着她的降临。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:45","timestamp":1792395938705,"roundId":"round_1792395897944_vcutv4dum","generatedMode":false,"type":"state","hasThinking":true,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780972160530_vxmy3pybz","characterId":"cdb984bf-99fb-4b68-ba65-6d2ddf695db0","_id":191982},{"id":1792394860931,"text":"拿法式舌吻来抵账啊？","rawContent":"拿法式舌吻来抵账啊？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:45","timestamp":1792395938911,"roundId":"round_1792395897944_vcutv4dum","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780972160530_vxmy3pybz","characterId":"cdb984bf-99fb-4b68-ba65-6d2ddf695db0","_id":191983},{"id":1792394860932,"text":"林考官这算盘打得，简直是作弊。","rawContent":"林考官这算盘打得，简直是作弊。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:45","timestamp":1792395939116,"roundId":"round_1792395897944_vcutv4dum","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780972160530_vxmy3pybz","characterId":"cdb984bf-99fb-4b68-ba65-6d2ddf695db0","_id":191984},{"id":1792394860933,"text":"不准再叫考官了","sender":"me","time":"15:45","timestamp":1792395954109,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780972160530_vxmy3pybz","characterId":"cdb984bf-99fb-4b68-ba65-6d2ddf695db0","_id":191985},{"id":1792394860934,"text":"你喜欢这种情趣play下次我们试试","sender":"me","time":"15:46","timestamp":1792395964425,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780972160530_vxmy3pybz","c